WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.376
That night Friar Tuck feasted and sang with Robin and his men.

2
00:00:08.377 --> 00:00:15.200
Robin told Alan of Dale's sad story to the friar, and then explained his own plan.

3
00:00:15.201 --> 00:00:22.022
"My plan can work, but I need your help with something," added Robin.

4
00:00:22.023 --> 00:00:27.022
Friar Tuck didn't hesitate. "I can do it," he agreed.

5
00:00:27.023 --> 00:00:29.222
"I'll marry Alan and Ellen."

6
00:00:29.223 --> 00:00:32.500
"Good!" said Robin.

7
00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:36.086
The next morning was Ellen's wedding to Sir Stephen.

8
00:00:36.087 --> 00:00:43.216
Robin surprised his men by dressing in bright, striped clothes and carrying a harp.

9
00:00:43.217 --> 00:00:48.951
"Look!" said Little John, pointing at Robin. "It's a colorful bird!"

10
00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:52.377
The men roared with laughter.

11
00:00:52.378 --> 00:00:54.985
Robin was laughing too.

12
00:00:54.986 --> 00:00:58.889
"This is my disguise for Alan's wedding," he explained.

13
00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:03.654
"I'm a minstrel. Carry these two bags of gold for me, Little John."

14
00:01:03.655 --> 00:01:07.569
Robin set off for the church with Alan and twenty other men.

15
00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:11.806
When they arrived, they hid outside behind a wall.

16
00:01:11.807 --> 00:01:15.909
They were waiting for someone to come to unlock the church door.

17
00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:19.600
At last an old friar appeared.

18
00:01:19.601 --> 00:01:24.907
As he struggled with some keys, Friar Tuck stepped up to help him.

19
00:01:24.908 --> 00:01:31.696
"I hear there's a wedding today," said Friar Tuck. "I'd like to see that." "You're

20
00:01:31.697 --> 00:01:36.571
welcome to stay for the wedding," said the old friar. Friar

21
00:01:36.572 --> 00:01:42.065
Tuck unlocked the door and the two men entered the church. Robin

22
00:01:42.066 --> 00:01:45.130
sat outside by the door. He

23
