soon spotted six men approaching on horses. The

24
00:01:49.527 --> 00:01:52.772
Bishop of Hereford was in the lead. His

25
00:01:52.773 --> 00:01:58.810
clothes were made of beautiful silk; a gold chain dangled from his neck. Robin

26
00:01:58.811 --> 00:02:03.579
frowned. "That bishop is dressed like a prince. He

27
00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:06.898
got his money from cheating the poor!" The

28
