Stephen was a tall, thin man with gray hair. Beside

37
00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:47.063
him rode the bride's father. Next

38
00:02:47.064 --> 00:02:50.893
came the bride, Ellen, in a carriage. She

39
00:02:50.894 --> 00:02:54.873
was very pretty, but she looked very sad. Behind

40
00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:58.349
her rode some knights. "Play

41
00:02:58.350 --> 00:03:02.373
your harp now," the bishop said to Robin. "No,

42
00:03:02.374 --> 00:03:06.558
it's not the right time," said Robin quickly. He

43
00:03:06.559 --> 00:03:10.262
really had no idea how to play a harp! Everyone

44
00:03:10.263 --> 00:03:13.433
entered the church. Robin

45
00:03:13.434 --> 00:03:19.431
stepped forward. "What kind of wedding is this?" he shouted. "The

46
00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:25.097
groom is too old! And the bride is engaged to another man!" Robin

47
00:03:25.098 --> 00:03:33.887
blew his horn three times and Alan burst through the door with Robin's other men. Ellen's

48
00:03:33.888 --> 00:03:39.192
face lit up. "Alan!" she cried happily. Ellen's

49
