Robin Hood, and I say Ellen will marry Alan!" "Please,

53
00:03:55.905 --> 00:03:59.224
Father!" begged Ellen. "I'm

54
00:03:59.225 --> 00:04:01.882
in love with Alan." "You'll

55
00:04:01.883 --> 00:04:06.531
marry Sir Stephen or no one!" shouted her father. Sir

56
